d their commanding officer Frolaytia Capistrano as the unit treks all over the globe to fight battle after battle. Facing one impossible situation after another, they must summon all their wit and courage to overcome the insurmountable foes that are Objects."},"tags":[{"name":"War","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ships","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanks","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Snowscape","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":28,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Heavy Object","english":null,"native":"ヘヴィーオブジェクト","romaji":"Heavy Object","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"重装武器"}]},"trailer":{"id":"cZDDuFj_qmg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cZDDuFj_qmg/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}